abstract: >
  BizDiag is an open-source software suite for intelligent enterprise
  architecture and digital strategy automation. It combines ArchiMate,
  jArchi scripting, Java, artificial intelligence, and automated
  documentation to support enterprise architecture analysis,
  digital transformation, and strategic decision-making.
